headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

docs {
  # List Connected Tunnels
  
  This endpoint returns all currently connected tunnel clients.
  
  ## Response
  
  Returns a JSON object with an array of connected tunnel clients:
  
  ```json
  {
    "tunnels": [
      {
        "client_id": "client1",
        "connected": true,
        "last_active": "2023-09-23T20:00:00Z"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  Use this to check which CLI clients are available for sending requests.
}